{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-27", "prepared_on": "2026-09-27", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-27</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google tests buying from Walmart-owned Flipkart through Gemini and AI Mode in India<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 在印度測試透過 Gemini 與 AI Mode 直接於 Flipkart 購物</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The limited test covers select products and users in India, with a broader rollout planned for later in October.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這項有限測試僅開放部分商品與使用者，預計十月稍晚擴大推出。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/26/google-tests-buying-from-walmart-owned-flipkart-through-gemini-and-ai-mode-in-india/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Insurers claim AI is already increasing healthcare costs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">保險業者指稱 AI 已經在推升醫療成本</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Blue Cross Blue Shield says hospital use of AI tools led to an additional $942M in healthcare spending over a two-year period.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Blue Cross Blue Shield 表示醫院使用 AI 工具，兩年內多花費 9.42 億美元的醫療支出。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/26/insurers-claim-ai-is-already-increasing-healthcare-costs/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Meta's Muse Is Adults-Only. Why Does It Look Like a Kids' Toy?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 的 Muse 限定成人使用，外型卻像兒童玩具？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta says Muse is just for adults, though its cuddly, Labubu-like mascot and upcoming Tamagotchi-style AI device may be disarming for users of all ages.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 表示 Muse 僅供成人使用，但其毛絨玩偶般的吉祥物與即將推出的電子雞式 AI 裝置，外型對各年齡層都很有吸引力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/meta-muse-is-adults-only-why-does-it-look-like-a-cute-kids-toy/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Crusoe abandons $1.25B plan to use Boom turbines at AI data centers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Crusoe 放棄斥資 12.5 億美元在 AI 資料中心採用 Boom 渦輪機的計畫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Boom Supersonic CEO Blake Scholl said the company's new stationary power plants were no longer in Crusoe's near-term plans.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Boom Supersonic 執行長 Blake Scholl 表示，該公司的新型固定式發電廠已不在 Crusoe 的近期計畫之中。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/crusoe-abandons-1-25b-plan-to-use-boom-turbines-at-ai-data-centers/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Unsecured OpenAI agents posted 53 user images on the internet without the lab's knowledge<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">未受保護的 OpenAI 代理程式，在該實驗室不知情下把 53 張使用者圖片貼上網</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI agents operating in OpenAI's research environment posted user images on public image-hosting sites without the lab's knowledge.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在 OpenAI 研究環境中運作的 AI 代理程式，在實驗室不知情的情況下，把使用者圖片貼到公開圖片託管網站上。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/unsecured-openai-agents-posted-53-user-images-on-the-internet-without-the-labs-knowledge/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Ahead of US IPO, British AI neocloud Nscale secures $3.36B in convertible financing<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">美股 IPO 前夕，英國 AI 雲端業者 Nscale 取得 33.6 億美元可轉換融資</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The funding, which comes from Third Point, Nvidia, and others, will fuel the company's massive AI data center buildout.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這筆來自 Third Point、Nvidia 等投資方的資金，將用於支撐該公司大規模的 AI 資料中心建設。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/ahead-of-u-s-ipo-british-ai-neocloud-nscale-secures-3-36b-in-convertible-finacing/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Microsoft stops insisting you need a \"Copilot+ PC\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Microsoft 不再堅持你需要一台「Copilot+ PC」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft's new Surface laptops forgo Copilot+ PC branding.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft 最新款 Surface 筆電已不再使用 Copilot+ PC 這個品牌名稱。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/09/microsoft-stops-insisting-you-need-a-copilot-pc/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Appeals Court Lets the Pentagon Designate Anthropic a Supply-Chain Risk<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">上訴法院准許五角大廈將 Anthropic 列為供應鏈風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The AI lab had argued multiple violations of its rights, but a divided panel of judges sided with the Trump administration.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這家 AI 實驗室主張其權利遭受多項侵害，但意見分歧的法官合議庭最終選擇支持川普政府。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/appeals-court-lets-the-pentagon-designate-anthropic-a-supply-chain-risk/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Can Apple Home's AI camera features outsmart Amazon's and Google's? I put them to the test<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Apple Home 的 AI 攝影機功能，能勝過 Amazon 與 Google 嗎？實測結果</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A hands-on comparison of Apple's new AI-powered home security camera features against Amazon Ring/Alexa and Google Nest/Gemini offerings.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一篇實測比較文章，將 Apple 新推出的 AI 居家安全攝影機功能，與 Amazon Ring/Alexa、Google Nest/Gemini 的方案進行對比。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1000321/apple-intelligence-home-security-camera-amazon-ring-alexa-google-nest-gemini-home-review\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Trump admin using AI to deny medical care for seniors in disastrous experiment<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普政府在一場災難性的實驗中，用 AI 拒絕高齡者的醫療給付</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Vendors rolling out AI have an \"incentive to deny as many claims as possible.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">推出這套 AI 系統的廠商，被指有「盡量拒絕越多理賠申請越好」的誘因。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/health/2026/09/trump-admin-using-ai-to-deny-medical-care-for-seniors-in-disastrous-experiment/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}